As a Public Benefit Corporation, we’re working toward a world where: 

-The technical problems of AI safety are solved;
-AI safety is a universal practice backstopped by law;
-AI strengthens democracy and global stability;
-AI expands prosperity and human flourishing; and
-AI’s benefits are shared by everyone.

Today we’re publishing our first Public Benefit Report, which measures our progress toward each of these five pillars. We’ll publish a further review every year from now on.

